sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Browser / app
    participant OS as OS stub resolver
    participant ISP as ISP resolver (outside tunnel)
    participant VPN as VPN DNS resolver (inside tunnel)

    Note over App,OS: VPN is connected, but DNS is still<br/>pointed at the ISP resolver (or leaks via split DNS)
    App->>OS: resolve example.com
    OS--xVPN: query NOT sent into tunnel
    OS->>ISP: DNS query for example.com (plaintext UDP 53)
    Note over ISP: ISP sees the domain you asked for,<br/>even though the web traffic is tunneled
    ISP-->>OS: answer (real IP)
    OS-->>App: answer
    App->>App: opens HTTPS to example.com through the tunnel